WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:15.481
I like to swing a lot!

2
00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:21.054
When I go higher, I hold on tight.

3
00:00:21.055 --> 00:00:28.430
When I go higher, I do many things.

4
00:00:28.431 --> 00:00:34.612
When I go higher, I smell the sunflowers.

5
00:00:34.613 --> 00:00:41.479
When I go higher, I say hi to the birds.

6
00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:45.702
When I go higher, I almost touch the clouds.

7
00:00:45.703 --> 00:00:50.584
Push me higher, please!

8
00:00:50.585 --> 00:00:55.185
When I go higher, I almost touch the airplane.

9
00:00:55.186 --> 00:01:00.068
Push me higher, please!

10
00:01:00.069 --> 00:01:04.271
When I go higher, I almost touch the sun.

11
00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:09.349
Push me lower, please!

12
00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:14.542
When I go lower, I say good-bye to the clouds.

13
00:01:14.543 --> 00:01:20.419
Push me lower, please!

14
00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:25.335
When I go lower, I say good-bye to the birds.

15
00:01:25.336 --> 00:01:29.607
Push me lower, please!

16
00:01:29.608 --> 00:01:34.777
When I go lower, I say good-bye to the sunflowers.

17
00:01:34.778 --> 00:01:38.659
Push me lower, please!

18
00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:43.422
Help me stop, please!

19
00:01:43.423 --> 00:01:49.116
I like to swing.
